Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.34,0:00:16.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice of you to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.05,0:00:20.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I welcome you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.72,0:00:27.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't look very welcoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.16,0:00:30.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am he who was entrusted to guard this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.99,0:00:34.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For the time being, \Nyou may call me Number 48.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.85,0:00:36.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Number 48?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.49,0:00:40.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been so long. I'm delighted to be able to go against someone so capable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.47,0:00:42.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have run out of luck \Nby coming up against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.04,0:00:46.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do not think ill of me, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.94,0:00:52.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you, don't think ill of me for being the kid who defeated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.16,0:01:04.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice. You move well for your size. \NThat's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.69,0:01:05.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.67,0:01:08.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should respond when \Nasked who I am, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.34,0:01:14.42,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,My name is Number 66. \NAlthough, that's just what they call me at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.84,0:01:16.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Number 66?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.44,0:01:19.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. I do have my own, proper name as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.23,0:01:21.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but if you heard it, you'd be \Nso surprised you'd wet yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.68,0:01:24.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you when I finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.06,0:01:31.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His reflexes...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.86,0:01:33.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.45,0:01:38.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.80,0:01:45.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.85,0:01:51.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.09,0:01:57.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the same kind of armored body as Al?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.92,0:02:09.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything \Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.67,0:02:14.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything, \Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.92,0:02:19.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's \NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.68,0:02:25.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that \Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.72,0:04:05.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.26,0:04:07.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought, you're hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.61,0:04:11.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Surprising. You've done well to realize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.06,0:04:14.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I spar against someone like you all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.81,0:04:16.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I could tell by \Nthe way you moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.94,0:04:21.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's someone like me \Nin the outside world, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.79,0:04:23.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It bugs me to think
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.24,0:04:29.47,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,that there's some idiot besides me who \Nthought of bonding a soul to a suit of armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.47,0:04:31.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.28,0:04:34.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Allow me to reintroduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.22,0:04:39.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Number 48" is the label I had as a condemned prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.39,0:04:43.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Officially, I'm supposed to have been executed two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.97,0:04:45.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A condemned prisoner?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.46,0:04:48.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which means that, sure enough, there's a connection
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.55,0:04:51.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}between the 5th Laboratory here and the prison next door.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.31,0:04:56.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I had a flesh-and-blood body, \NI was called "The Slicer."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.62,0:04:59.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was a mass murderer, \Nwho caused many public disturbances.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.84,0:05:04.22,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Nowadays, my skills have been called upon, \Nand I am the immortal watchdog over this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.22,0:05:06.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, you're not immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.12,0:05:07.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.02,0:05:09.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your bloodseal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.89,0:05:16.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The iron within the blood is attuned with the metal of your armor,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.68,0:05:19.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and that is what keeps your soul \Nbound to this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.55,0:05:26.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If that seal is broken, you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.96,0:05:34.45,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,It appears that after all this time, \NI've encountered someone with a little backbone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.45,0:05:37.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This should prove to be an interesting fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.93,0:05:39.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your weak spot \Nhas been exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.93,0:05:41.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're going to surrender, now's the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.91,0:05:43.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.11,0:05:47.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the type who seeks a little tension in battle, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.02,0:05:53.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.36,0:05:55.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,En garde!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.62,0:06:35.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What was that? Just now there was something strange in my shoulder...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.50,0:06:39.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Since it's less heavy, \Nits strength has dropped as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.59,0:06:41.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so make sure you don't do anything reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.22,0:06:46.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to finish this quickly, or I'm in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.89,0:07:05.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just like a monkey, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.13,0:07:07.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, what'd you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.48,0:07:11.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been ages since I've had \Nsuch responsive prey. I'm delighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.18,0:07:14.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, judging by your wound and your exhaustion,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.59,0:07:16.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the end of this battle is in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.66,0:07:21.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As you can see, \Nmy body knows no fatigue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.24,0:07:28.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Surrender. Right now, my companion is disposing of your partner outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.01,0:07:30.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't rely on him to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.31,0:07:36.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, this companion \Nof yours—is he strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.43,0:07:39.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's strong although not to \Nthe same extent as myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.78,0:07:42.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.59,0:07:45.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, \NI don't need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.98,0:07:51.36,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,I've been sparring with him \Nfor a long time, but I've never won.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.79,0:08:00.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.12,0:08:02.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold still so I can chop you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.16,0:08:07.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You miserable behemoth!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.92,0:08:13.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to hurt you \Nfor all you're worth!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.51,0:08:15.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.85,0:08:19.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.02,0:08:23.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm taking a shoulder roast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.51,0:08:39.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now you've gone and done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.33,0:08:42.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My head fell off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.99,0:08:46.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your body...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.56,0:08:51.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Thanks to certain circumstances, I've wound up with this body.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.56,0:08:54.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't tell who I am, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.68,0:08:58.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.18,0:09:02.60,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Thanks to you guys catching me, \NI was made a condemned criminal, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.60,0:09:06.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Number 66 was my label on death row.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.60,0:09:10.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I still had a flesh-and-blood body, the name people called me by was...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.25,0:09:14.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the serial killer, Barry the Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.95,0:09:16.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Barry the Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.09,0:09:21.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Barry? You mean, from back then?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.79,0:09:23.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.29,0:09:25.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After being caught and executed,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.74,0:09:31.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've come back from the depths of hell \Nto take revenge against you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.63,0:09:37.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.30,0:09:40.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't "you don't say" me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.52,0:09:43.68,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,People get surprised when \Nan executed prisoner is still alive, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.68,0:09:45.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And what's more, when a beheaded suit of armor still moves around,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.88,0:09:47.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you should be more like "Gyaah!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.31,0:09:50.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or like "Waah!" or like "What's the deal with your body?!" or like...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.58,0:09:53.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gyaah! What's the deal \Nwith your body?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.32,0:09:56.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's awful. You'll hurt my feelings, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.96,0:09:59.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you a fellow \Nexecuted prisoner too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.41,0:10:01.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm no criminal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.33,0:10:04.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so, now that I know, this fight is all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.93,0:10:07.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know what your weakness is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.83,0:10:12.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I destroy the bloodseal within \Nthat armor someplace, you will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.59,0:10:14.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brace yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.23,0:10:16.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The same goes for you too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.13,0:10:21.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but you don't know \Nwhere my bloodseal is, do you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:23.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you don't know \Nwhere mine is, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.09,0:10:27.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At this point,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.76,0:10:30.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to slice you up and \Nfind out where your bloodseal is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.94,0:10:34.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's with him? Jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.92,0:10:37.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,B Block and C Block have both turned up nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.86,0:10:40.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He must still be in the area somewhere! Find him, whatever it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.81,0:10:41.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.85,0:10:48.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's pretty bold to be staging an attack on a military facility like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.24,0:10:53.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, why is Scar so preoccupied with coming after Edward-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.80,0:10:56.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So then, where are \Nthe Elric brothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.51,0:11:00.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, well, you see... \NIt's like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.09,0:11:04.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're acting suspiciously!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.30,0:11:09.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major Armstrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.52,0:11:14.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With your authorization, \Ncould I have the forces here relocate?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.43,0:11:15.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.32,0:11:18.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Elric brothers are currently
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.37,0:11:20.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,at the Central 5th Laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.46,0:11:24.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Tell me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.19,0:11:55.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? \NYour movements are growing poorer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.60,0:11:57.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you through already, Pee-Wee?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.98,0:12:01.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling too small to even see, who doesn't even make for a good target?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.88,0:12:04.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At least your spirits are high.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.75,0:12:07.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I wonder how much longer that will last!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.42,0:12:14.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not the Automail again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.21,0:12:20.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're open!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:39.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You hold me in too low a regard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.36,0:12:45.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you think you could best me \Nfrom a spear's distance?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.95,0:12:47.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.20,0:12:53.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've done well to have fought this long. However, you have reached your limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.71,0:13:03.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Resign yourself. \NThere is no way you can win now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.47,0:13:08.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.22,0:13:12.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're forgetting that I'm not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.73,0:13:15.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.23,0:13:18.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When did you get in here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.23,0:13:23.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.53,0:13:31.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.31,0:13:40.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All is fair in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.17,0:13:55.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? \NMy bloodseal is not yet broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.53,0:13:59.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If your soul is in your head,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.78,0:14:03.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then once I cut it off, \Nyour body is just a hunk of iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.75,0:14:05.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to \Nfight you any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:09.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never mind that, there's something I wanted to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.31,0:14:11.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Philosopher's Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.84,0:14:16.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you've come to investigate this place, there is little else you could be after.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.91,0:14:18.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, \Nwe can cut to the chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.82,0:14:21.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you tell me \Neverything you know about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:22.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.62,0:14:23.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.96,0:14:27.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, beaten dogs \Ndon't get to show me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.42,0:14:29.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll break your bloodseal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.84,0:14:32.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I haven't lost yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.29,0:14:42.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.23,0:14:44.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:53.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One set of armor isn't necessarily limited to one soul, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.30,0:15:00.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The body has a bloodseal as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.62,0:15:03.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, \Nmy older brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.50,0:15:06.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just barely, \Nmy younger brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:07.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Younger brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.63,0:15:10.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did I forget to mention that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.58,0:15:13.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The mass murderer known as the Slicer...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.48,0:15:16.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,was a pair of mass-murdering brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.81,0:15:21.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An independent head and body, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.73,0:15:23.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That reeks of foul play!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.53,0:15:28.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who was it that said \N"All is fair in battle"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.13,0:15:32.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How dare you injure my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.38,0:15:35.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to pay for that, Pipsqueak!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.13,0:15:36.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't call me Pipsqueak!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.45,0:15:39.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't underestima—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.54,0:15:44.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa, I'm not giving you any time to transmute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.61,0:15:52.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm losing too much blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.34,0:15:54.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm seriously starting to get lightheaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.62,0:16:09.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is serious trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.02,0:16:13.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am I going to die here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.12,0:16:17.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.66,0:16:19.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I die here...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.54,0:16:23.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I die here...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.05,0:16:28.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,who's going to return \NAl back to normal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.13,0:16:31.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How dare you \Ndo that to my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.97,0:16:37.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can do that too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.51,0:16:40.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't give you \Nenough time to transmute!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.93,0:16:47.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just remembered that nasty fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.80,0:16:59.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.81,0:17:01.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He didn't perform transmutation,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:04.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}just the decomposition technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.43,0:17:13.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.63,0:17:16.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't die just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.94,0:17:20.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Now you've gone and done it, you dirty brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.44,0:17:21.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ick!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.45,0:17:26.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you! Dammit! \NI deserve better than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.24,0:17:29.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn. Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.75,0:17:34.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As much as it pains me, \Nwe've lost, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.76,0:17:38.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me that there's \Nactually three of you brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.19,0:17:40.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.19,0:17:40.12,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.41,0:17:42.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well done, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.35,0:17:45.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This time, you truly are victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.60,0:17:49.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well then, this time, \Ntell me everything you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.36,0:17:51.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I cannot tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.02,0:17:54.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, destroy us at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.12,0:17:55.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.38,0:17:58.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing remains for the defeated except death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.05,0:18:00.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is our rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.55,0:18:05.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not about to kill anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.89,0:18:08.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmph! You're far too generous!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.21,0:18:12.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With our bodies like this, \Ncan you possibly call us "someone"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.17,0:18:14.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't tell you to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.91,0:18:17.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you to {\i1}destroy{\i0} us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.16,0:18:20.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.50,0:18:31.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I were to concede that you aren't people,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.22,0:18:34.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd... I'd have to concede \Nthat my younger brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.56,0:18:39.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, is not a person either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.13,0:18:42.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your younger brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.61,0:18:55.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.94,0:18:59.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hasn't this gone on long enough, already?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.14,0:19:01.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm concerned about Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.53,0:19:03.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.00,0:19:06.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That pipsqueak alchemist \Nis your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.48,0:19:09.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother gets angry \Nif you mention his height.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.31,0:19:12.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.29,0:19:15.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.05,0:19:20.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So it was your brother who \Ngave you that armored form!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.24,0:19:23.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right. He risked \Nhis life to transmute me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.38,0:19:25.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's rich!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.03,0:19:28.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.15,0:19:31.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, how rude of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.56,0:19:34.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brotherly love is so beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.15,0:19:38.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if it {\i1}is{\i0} false affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.86,0:19:40.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,False?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.11,0:19:43.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right! False love!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.05,0:19:47.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not so! \NMy brother genuinely loves me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.70,0:19:51.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a perfectly naïve fellow you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.07,0:19:54.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Suppose you were an imitation. What would you do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.25,0:19:57.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Suppose your personality and memories
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.12,0:20:03.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,were implanted in you as it suited \Nyour brother. What would you do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.05,0:20:05.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-That just isn't so!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.98,0:20:09.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am, without question, a person, whose name is Alphonse Elric!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.47,0:20:15.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As a spirit—something indefinite, \Nwhich cannot be seen with the eye—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.46,0:20:18.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,how are you to prove that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.14,0:20:24.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your brother—and the people around you—\Ncould all be deceiving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.91,0:20:26.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.56,0:20:27.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.70,0:20:32.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My brother is a person,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.21,0:20:33.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and you guys are people too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.89,0:20:37.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.83,0:20:38.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.89,0:20:45.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.93,0:20:49.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amusing... Quite amusing...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.95,0:20:52.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For as long as I can remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.61,0:20:54.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,my brother and I have made our lives
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.47,0:21:00.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,by stealing, breaking, killing, and being looked down upon as fiends and brutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.90,0:21:04.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that we've abandoned our bodies, to say nothing of our hearts and minds,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.20,0:21:08.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to think that, for the first time, \Nwe're being treated as people...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.33,0:21:12.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's so amusing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.36,0:21:16.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a person!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.04,0:21:18.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Alphonse Elric!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.69,0:21:22.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you have any proof that you ever really existed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.44,0:21:24.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is your body?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.43,0:21:25.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.40,0:21:27.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.76,0:21:29.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.55,0:21:32.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For all of it to be false...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.61,0:21:35.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That couldn't possibly be...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.54,0:21:38.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen, Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.10,0:21:42.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something... I've been meaning to say to you for a long time...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.01,0:21:44.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\t(2420)}but I've been too scared... \Nand I haven't been able to say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.48,0:21:46.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.88,0:21:49.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was Brother trying to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.72,0:21:52.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was it that \Nhe was too scared to...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.17,0:21:54.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,too scared to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.56,0:21:55.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.28,0:23:41.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.07,0:23:44.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 21: "The Red Glow"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.18,0:23:47.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If there's a color to people's lives...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.22,0:23:51.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that's probably the color it would be.
